# General quality

- Inspect existing files before changing them.
- Make small and focused changes.
- Do not rewrite working configuration without a clear reason.
- Follow the existing project style.
- Run available checks after changes.
- Report which checks were actually executed.
- Do not claim that a build or test passed if it was not run.
- Keep generated files owned by the current container user.
- Use simple B2 English in user documentation.
